abstract: "An interdisciplinary arithmetic research programme with formal Collatz supplements. A fresh automated audit verified all 305 inventoried theorem declarations across 36 mathematical Lean modules with no sorryAx dependencies. Counts include supporting and repeated results. This is not a proof or disproof of the Collatz conjecture or independent peer review."
